# Checked out with LF on every platform.
#
# Git's autocrlf default on a Windows runner rewrites the working tree, and two
# things in this repository do not survive it: a shell script whose shebang
# line then ends in a carriage return, and the `// Output:` comment in an
# example, which is compared against output the test itself produced with LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
